    "updated_at": "2024-05-30T08:02:40Z",
    "body": "Thanks! However, you seem to have signed it as if you were invited by the Steering Group. I'm sorry if you got the impression I am the Steering Group, but that is not the case. Instead just sign it as an individual. Sorry that this is such a hassle for a simple typo fix!",
