    "created_at": "2024-05-31T06:43:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-05-31T06:43:17Z",
    "body": "> Just be sure you are using the full definition linked above\r\n\r\nWhat a misleading name; thanks for pointing this out. I read the \"work in the field of web technologies\" paragraph and didn't even think that _the field of web technologies_ could actually mean _standardization of web technologies_. I guess in that case I **don't** _work in the field of web technologies_. Signed.",
